# Working artifacts — regeneratable by the pipeline; canonical outputs go to S3
# (wcmc-reciterai-hierarchy, wcmc-reciterai-artifacts). Backfill scripts now
# write hierarchy_full.json under out/ (already gitignored below); the
# repo-root pattern stays as a safety net against ad-hoc operator copies.
hierarchy_full.json
author_mapping.json
faculty_metadata.json
cwid_rollup.csv
cwid_subtopic_counts.csv
cwid_topic_counts.csv
cwid_topics_subtopics.json
scoring_results.json
